  SETUP & ASSET NOTES — please read before committing:

  1. Banner (header image):
     - The header references the local file `Banner.png` at the
       repo root. Make sure the file is pushed to GitHub so it
       renders on your profile (it is currently untracked).
     - Banner.PNG dimensions: 3412 x 1920 (16:9).

  2. Avatar:
     - Upload your avatar via Settings > Profile > Picture.

  3. Replace every PLACEHOLDER before committing:
     - GitHub username  : `PH4N70MC0DE`        -> your username
     - Typing lines     : the `lines=` values in the header SVG
     - Social links     : the `href="#"` links + email address
     - Trophy/stats     : theme names (see below)

  4. Color/theme swap:
     - Stats & streak use `theme=onedark` with explicit
       `bg_color=0d1117` / `title_color` etc. for one palette.
     - Activity graph uses `theme=react-dark`.
     - Trophy uses `theme=onedark`.
     - Swap any `theme=` value; valid github-readme-stats themes
       include: default, dark, radical, merko, gruvbox, tokyonight,
       onedark, cobalt, synthwave, highcontrast, dracula, prussian,
       monokai, nightowl, city_lights, github_dark, codeSTACKr, etc.

  5. Markdown-safe image sources used:
     - All external badges come from img.shields.io, and widgets from
       readme-typing-svg.demolab.com / github-readme-stats.vercel.app /
       github-profile-trophy.vercel.app / github-readme-activity-graph
       .cyclic.app, all of which render reliably in profile READMEs.
